# Scan-derived formats. tapgraft-color exports a client scan's colour as
# PLY/GLB, and Object Capture produces USDZ plus HEIC/JPEG source photos.
# AGENTS.md forbids committing client scans; without these rules that was
# enforced by habit alone.
*.ply
*.glb
*.gltf
*.usdz
*.usda
*.usdc
*.heic
*.heif
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
uploads/
previews/
thumbnails/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/
Dockerfile.local
docker-compose.override.yml
templates/custom/
lib/BOSL2/.git/
!assets/
!assets/*.svg
!assets/*.png
# Reusable base meshes are tracked despite the global *.stl rule above.
!assets/bases/
!assets/bases/*.stl

# Python packaging artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Swift helper binary compiled on first use
tools/usdz2obj
